    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=3h9XXZTrrbwcvJYy]], each creature in a 30-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} (demons automatically succeed on this save). <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Unconscious apply=false] condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns. The target succeeds automatically after 10 minutes or if it takes damage or a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to empty a flask of Holy Water on it. <em>Success:</em> The target is immune to this [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s Drone for 24 hours.</p>",
